(A multicentre investigation examined home blood pressure monitoring against standard care in) Tj
T*
(117 adults with hypertension. The intervention showed a small but measurable benefit for) Tj
T*
(glycaemic control, while treatment exposure and adverse events were broadly comparable) Tj
T*
(between groups. The findings should be considered alongside short follow-up and incomplete) Tj
T*
(adherence data. Recruitment pathways and treatment fidelity were examined to support) Tj
T*
(interpretation of the estimates. This report is from a parallel-group randomized controlled) Tj
